# IINA runtimes

Main is player-local JavaScriptCore (`mpv`, events, core). Global JSC has no player
`mpv`, event, or core. UI (sidebar/overlay/standalone) has DOM plus a narrow message
port, not host APIs. Shared code has neither.

Never bypass with `any`, `@ts-ignore`, dynamic evaluation, or a broad ambient import.
Confirm symbols in `docs/agent/runtime.md` before adding APIs.
